40760:The defined values for the style:text-underline-style attribute are: 
40761-
40762-•none: text has no underlining.  
40763-
40764-•dash: text has a dashed line underlining it.  
40765-
40766-•dot-dash: text has a line whose repeating pattern is a dot followed by a dash underlining it. 
40767-
40768-•dot-dot-dash: text has a line whose repeating pattern is two dots followed by a dash underlining it.  
40769-
40770-•dotted: text has a dotted line underlining it.  
40771-
40772-•long-dash: text has a dashed line whose dashes are longer than the ones from the dashed line for value dash underlining it.  
